<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch 1996 sugarbeet yield at 55 tonne/hectare - CBS.</title>
<headline>Dutch 1996 sugarbeet yield at 55 tonne/hectare - CBS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dutch sugarbeet crop yield is estimated at 55 tonnes per hectare against 56 tonnes in 1995, the Dutch Statistical Office (CBS) said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
